ed it, but please confirm.\n- **Hartford Aug 3.** Moss's 8/3 digest describes a Sev 1 on the Hartford appointment board and a duplicate check-in complaint. It gives no ticket numbers for either.\n- **Other digests.** The digests from 3/10/2025, 7/7/2025, 12/1/2025 and 5/3/2026, and the cheat sheet, mention Vantorre Group but give no ticket numbers. The 3/10/2025 entry is only an email from Mateo about gate check-in delays."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
